- Ini awak.
- Terima kasih.

180
00:17:02.126 --> 00:17:03.327
Berikan kepada saya.

181
00:17:05.663 --> 00:17:06.898
Di sini anda pergi.

182
00:17:19.310 --> 00:17:21.012
(Warm and Cozy French Home Cooking)

183
00:17:28.619 --> 00:17:30.221
